476","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/2f0e52501af6c0f0c31d30058e43980a6314ce70/ss_2f0e52501af6c0f0c31d30058e43980a6314ce70.600x338.jpg?t=1756547476"},{"id":7,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/476c78494a6ecdfe39dc3fd9b9403c11c38c333a/ss_476c78494a6ecdfe39dc3fd9b9403c11c38c333a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756547476","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/476c78494a6ecdfe39dc3fd9b9403c11c38c333a/ss_476c78494a6ecdfe39dc3fd9b9403c11c38c333a.600x338.jpg?t=1756547476"},{"id":8,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/2c80259878d676547cf322295157e042409cdf8c/ss_2c80259878d676547cf322295157e042409cdf8c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756547476","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/2c80259878d676547cf322295157e042409cdf8c/ss_2c80259878d676547cf322295157e042409cdf8c.600x338.jpg?t=1756547476"},{"id":9,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/f337c152c7e7ecfa9263d5fdfbeb5c1e80247796/ss_f337c152c7e7ecfa9263d5fdfbeb5c1e80247796.1920x1080.jpg?t=1756547476","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669360/f337c152c7e7ecfa9263d5fdfbeb5c1e80247796/ss_f337c152c7e7ecfa9263d5fdfbeb5c1e80247796.600x338.jpg?t=1756547476"}],"short_description":"UMAMI is a cozy 3D food puzzle game where every level is a handcrafted, sensory experience. Tinker, rotate, and fit wooden blocks together to build mouthwatering food towers and fantastical cakes, all in a comfy atmosphere, like tidying a bento box\u00a0for\u00a0the\u00a0soul.","steam_appid":3669360,"support_info":{"email":"contact@mimmox.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian",